{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000000",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 连续时间马尔可夫链 · 学习地图\n\n先用局部速率、真实跳跃路径和有限时长转移三种视角读懂同一个 CTMC，再处理模型、爆炸边界、长期行为与完整路径估计。\n\n颜色只区分语义角色，不表示掌握度；点击标题进入对应原子。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 5000,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7a1000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · 同一个过程的三种入口\n\n第一行读局部速率，第二行读一次真实跳跃怎样发生，第三行把瞬时规律推进到任意时长。三行互相补充，不是三套不同模型。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 5000,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC定义|Continuous-time Markov chain]]\n\nDiscrete states, a continuous clock and jump paths. Given the current state and clock time, earlier history adds no predictive information. Homogeneity is an additional condition.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n连续时钟、离散状态、跳跃路径；当前状态与时点已提供预测所需信息。时间齐次另作假设。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nCompare equal durations from the same state at different clock times.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n比较同一起点、等长区间是否与起始时点无关。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC时间齐次转移函数|Time-homogeneous transitions]]\n\n$P(h)$ depends on elapsed duration $h$, not the starting clock time. A fixed rule can still produce a changing state distribution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n相同起点、相同时长使用同一转移规律；转移齐次不等于状态分布平稳。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nIn the standard homogeneous jump model with finite local exit rates, Q records derivatives at duration zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n标准齐次跳模型中，各状态的出口率分别有限，Q 记录零时长右导数。",
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[生成矩阵约束|Generator matrix]]\n\nOff-diagonal rates are nonnegative; each exit rate is finite and $q_{ii}=-\\sum_{j\\ne i}q_{ij}$. Zero Q-row sums alone do not rule out explosion on countably many states.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非对角元记录速率，对角抵消总出口率；Q 行和为零与无限状态过程非爆炸需分开。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nMultiply rates by a short duration; retain only the first-order probability change.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n速率乘短时长，只保留概率变化的一阶项。",
      "x": 2130,
      "y": 95,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC短时概率展开|Short-time probabilities]]\n\nFor fixed $i,j$, $p_{ij}(h)=\\delta_{ij}+hq_{ij}+o(h)$; $\\delta_{ij}=1$ when $i=j$ and $0$ otherwise. Finite-state matrix notation is valid; unbounded rates need extra control for uniform errors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n逐项短时一阶近似；余项也来自单次等待的非线性，不能只归因于多跳。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC指数停留时间|Exponential holding times]]\n\nFor a standard homogeneous pure-jump chain, a positive finite exit rate $q_i$ gives an exponential wait with mean $1/q_i$. Rate zero gives an infinite absorbing wait.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n齐次纯跳链中，正有限出口率决定指数等待；零率吸收另行处理。“未离开”不同于“离开后又返回”。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPositive exit rate is the exponential parameter; zero rate means absorption.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正出口率是指数参数，零率对应吸收。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 535,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[出口率|Exit rate]]\n\n$q_i=\\sum_{j\\ne i}q_{ij}=-q_{ii}$ combines all ways to leave. It has inverse-time units, not probability units; $1/q_i$ is the mean wait when $q_i>0$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n总出口率合并各离开方向的速率；决定等多久，不独自决定下一站去哪。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nAt positive-rate states, divide each outgoing rate by their total.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正出口率状态中，各方向速率除以总率。",
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 535,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000001a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[嵌入跳链|Embedded jump chain]]\n\nRecord the state at each genuine change. For $q_i>0$, $r_{ij}=q_{ij}/q_i$ for $j\\ne i$, and $r_{ii}=0$. An absorbing self-loop only completes the discrete record.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n跳链保存状态顺序，舍去时长；吸收补全与均匀化虚事件都不计作真实跳跃。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[生成矩阵分解|Generator decomposition]]\n\nConditional on a positive-rate entry state, waiting time and next destination are independent. With exit-rate diagonal $D$ and completed jump matrix $R$, $Q=D(R-I)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在给定本次进入状态后，把等待与去向分开；D 左乘按行缩放，零率行单独补全。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[竞争指数时钟|Competing exponential clocks]]\n\nA finite or countable family of independent clocks with rates $a_j\\ge0$ and $0<a=\\sum_j a_j<\\infty$ have a unique first ring: wait $\\mathrm{Exp}(a)$, winner probability $a_j/a$. Wait and winner are independent. Total rate zero means no event.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限或可数个独立时钟，总率正且有限时最小值取得且唯一；总率为零时无下一次事件。",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC转移半群|Transition semigroup]]\n\nFor homogeneous transitions, $P(s+t)=P(s)P(t)$ sums over the state at the intermediate time. It also holds for the minimal process on the original space, with row sums equal to survival probabilities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n时间齐次下，按中间观测时点拼接，不限制跳时；省略吸收墓地状态后，半群仍成立，行和可能小于一。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor finite homogeneous chains, split off a short interval at either end.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次链中，分别分解最初与最后一小段。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Kolmogorov前后向方程|Kolmogorov equations]]\n\nFor a finite homogeneous chain in row convention, backward $P'(t)=QP(t)$, forward $P'(t)=P(t)Q$, with $P(0)=I$. Resolve the first or last short interval.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先分解最初或最后一小段；“后向”不等于把路径倒放。可数无界率需另作分析。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe finite-state initial-value problem has one matrix-exponential solution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限状态初值问题的唯一解是矩阵指数。",
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC矩阵指数|CTMC matrix exponential]]\n\nFor a finite homogeneous chain, $P(t)=e^{tQ}$ is the unique transition solution. It is a matrix power series, valid without diagonalizability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限生成矩阵的指数把速率转成有限时长概率；不是逐元素指数，无界无限矩阵不能直接照搬。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7a1000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · 模型家族与爆炸边界\n\n纯生链有两个不同特化：逐级结构带来精确爆炸判据，常数出生率成为 Poisson 计数。一般链先辨认爆炸，再决定是否需要墓地状态；全局有界率同时给出非爆炸保证和均匀化算法。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1380,
      "width": 5000,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000001e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[纯生链|Pure-birth chains]]\n\nFrom level $n$, the only genuine jump is to $n+1$, at finite rate $\\lambda_n\\ge0$. Positive rates set exponential waits; a zero rate absorbs.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n路径逐级向上，但每层速度可以不同。可达零率会阻断路径；逐层有限率仍可能爆炸。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000001d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[纯生链爆炸判据|Pure-birth explosion criterion]]\n\nFrom $n_0$, if every reachable rate is positive and finite, nonexplosion is equivalent to $\\sum_{n\\ge n_0}1/\\lambda_n=\\infty$. A finite sum gives explosion a.s.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n沿可达的正率尾部求和；先检查是否遇到零率吸收，不能把任意链的状态率机械排成此级数。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Poisson是常速纯生链|Poisson as constant-rate births]]\n\nFrom count zero, a homogeneous unit-birth chain with constant $\\lambda>0$ is the rate-$\\lambda$ Poisson process: its waits are iid exponential.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n从零开始、单位向上跳、同一正速率共同给出 Poisson 过程律；状态依赖率与日历时变强度需区分。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[生灭链|Birth–death chains]]\n\nA homogeneous count process jumps only from $n$ to $n+1$ at rate $\\lambda_n$, or to $n-1$ at rate $\\mu_n$. Endpoints and zero rates matter; this structure alone guarantees neither nonexplosion nor stationarity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n齐次数量过程仅相邻增减一，速率下标指出发状态。边界与零率须明确；生灭结构本身不保证非爆炸或平稳。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC爆炸|Explosion]]\n\nIf genuine jump times $T_n$ accumulate at $\\zeta=\\lim_nT_n<\\infty$, infinitely many state changes occur in finite time. State the initial condition.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每次等待都可为正且局部率有限，总和仍可能有限；吸收态无限等待不属于爆炸。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nThe minimal construction terminates at explosion instead of adding returning paths.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n最小构造在爆炸时终止，不额外加入返回路径。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000001b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最小CTMC|Minimal CTMC]]\n\nAt explosion, enter an absorbing cemetery state. On the original state set, row sum $\\sum_jp_{ij}(t)=\\Pr_i(t<\\zeta)$ records survival.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n不把爆炸路径送回原空间；缺额是截至 t 爆炸的概率。Q 零行和不保证原空间的 P(t) 行和为一。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRe-entry after explosion is additional model information, requiring its own consistency check.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n爆炸后的重入规则是额外模型信息，须另行核验一致性。",
      "x": 1340,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000001c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[爆炸后延拓|Post-explosion extensions]]\n\nThe same local rates can support different later laws. Re-entry needs a specified, consistent rule; an independent restart is one example.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n初始分布与 Q 可能不足以确定爆炸后的过程；返回规则须另行核验 Markov 性与时序一致性。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有界率非爆炸|Bounded-rate nonexplosion]]\n\nFor a finite or countable stable conservative Q-matrix, a common finite bound $\\sup_iq_i<\\infty$ prevents explosion. It is sufficient, not necessary.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n统一有界不同于每个状态分别有限；全零率链吸收，无界率也可能非爆炸。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA finite clock rate $\\nu\\ge\\sup_iq_i$, with $\\nu>0$, gives exact randomization.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n选择支配所有出口率的正有限时钟率，得到精确随机化。",
      "x": 2930,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 260
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC均匀化|Uniformization]]\n\nChoose finite $\\nu>0$ with $\\nu\\ge\\sup_iq_i$. Let $R=I+Q/\\nu$ and an independent rate-$\\nu$ Poisson clock select how many R-steps occur. Virtual self-loops are allowed; the Poisson mixture gives the exact process law.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n候选事件允许虚自环。以 Poisson 权重混合 R 的各次幂，得到精确过程律，不是固定步长 Euler 近似。",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7a1000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## 3 · Classes, stationarity and convergence\n\nSeparate return events from calendar return times, then study countable-state equilibrium. Finite chains decompose over closed classes. Detailed balance and reversibility impose stronger symmetry than stationarity and lead to birth–death calculations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## 3 · 类结构、平稳与收敛\n\n先把“会不会回来”与“要花多少日历时间”分开，再讨论可数链的稳态。有限链按闭沟通类分解。详细平衡与可逆是比平稳更强的路径对称性，并可用于生灭链。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2420,
      "width": 5000,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[马氏链沟通类|Communicating classes]]\n\nMutual positive-probability reachability defines the classes. The adjacent bridge explains their use through the CTMC jump chain.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n双向正概率可达定义沟通类；旁边的桥说明怎样通过CTMC跳链使用这个定义。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor the minimal CTMC, positive-rate routes give the jump chain's communication graph.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n最小 CTMC 的正率路线给出与跳链相同的沟通图。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 2690,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[跳链决定CTMC沟通类|CTMC communicating classes]]\n\nFor a minimal chain with finite exit rates, finite positive-rate routes determine accessibility and classes. Keeping the same zero pattern preserves the classes. A closed infinite class may still explode.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n最小链各状态出口率有限时，有限正率路线决定可达与沟通类；保持零率位置便保持类划分。无限闭类仍可能爆炸。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[常返与停留时间|Recurrence and holding times]]\n\nFor a nonabsorbing state of a minimal chain, recurrence agrees with the jump chain. Positive recurrence uses mean calendar return time, including waits. Absorbing states have no genuine departure cycle.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非吸收态的常返性与跳链一致；正常返还要看包含停留的平均日历回返时间。吸收态没有真实离开周期。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b100000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor a nonabsorbing state, positive recurrence requires finite mean calendar return time.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非吸收态的正常返要求平均日历回返时间有限。",
      "x": 2130,
      "y": 2690,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可数CTMC稳态存在|Countable stationary existence]]\n\nOn at least two states, for an irreducible, nonexplosive homogeneous chain with finite exit rates, positive recurrence is equivalent to a unique stationary probability. Mean return cycles include the initial holding time.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n至少两个状态上，不可约、非爆炸且逐状态出口率有限的齐次链，正常返等价于唯一平稳概率存在；平均回返周期包含最初停留。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b100000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nRetain irreducibility and nonexplosion. Use equal-time observations and then fill the time gaps.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保留不可约与非爆炸；先看等间隔观测，再用局部连续界填补时刻间隙。",
      "x": 2930,
      "y": 2690,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可数CTMC平衡收敛|Countable CTMC convergence]]\n\nAn irreducible, nonexplosive homogeneous chain with finite exit rates and a stationary probability $\\pi$ converges to $\\pi$ from every initial law. No extra period condition is needed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n不可约、非爆炸、逐状态出口率有限的齐次链若有平稳概率，则从任意初始律逐坐标趋于它；无须另加周期条件。",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[跳链频率时间加权|Weight visits by duration]]\n\nIn a finite closed irreducible class with at least two states, jump proportions $\\alpha_i$ become time proportions $\\pi_i\\propto\\alpha_i/q_i$. Normalize; zero exit rates and infinite-state candidates need separate checks.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限闭不可约类至少有两状态时，访问比例除以正出口率再归一化。零出口率及无限状态候选须另查。",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 2650,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC平稳分布|Stationary distribution]]\n\nA probability row $\\pi$ is stationary when $\\pi P(t)=\\pi$ for every $t\\ge0$. It preserves the distribution, not each path. Existence, uniqueness and attraction from other starts are separate questions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n概率行对每个时长都满足 $\\pi P(t)=\\pi$；分布不变，路径仍可跳。存在、唯一和其他初态的收敛须分别判断。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2960,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b100000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFinite homogeneous chains: semigroup invariance becomes a normalized nonnegative left null vector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次链：半群不变性化为归一化非负左零向量。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 3000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000027",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有限CTMC平稳生成矩阵判据|Finite stationary criterion]]\n\nFor a finite homogeneous CTMC, stationarity is equivalent to $\\pi Q=0$, $\\pi_i\\ge0$ and $\\sum_i\\pi_i=1$. This is total flow balance; pairwise detailed balance is stronger.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次链中，平稳概率恰是归一化非负左零向量。这是总流平衡，不要求逐对详细平衡。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2960,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFinite irreducibility makes the probability solution unique and positive at every state.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限且不可约，使概率解唯一并且每项为正。",
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 3000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000020",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有限不可约CTMC稳态|Finite irreducible stationary law]]\n\nA finite irreducible homogeneous CTMC has exactly one stationary probability law, positive at every state. Periodicity of its genuine jump chain is irrelevant here. Irreducibility is sufficient, not necessary, for uniqueness.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限不可约齐次链有唯一、处处为正的平稳概率。真实跳链可有周期；不可约只是唯一性的充分条件。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2960,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b100000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor a finite chain, extend each closed-class law by zero and mix the resulting laws.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限链中，各闭类稳态在类外补零后取凸组合。",
      "x": 2130,
      "y": 3000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有限CTMC平稳分解|Finite stationary decomposition]]\n\nEvery stationary probability of a finite homogeneous CTMC is a unique mixture of its closed-class laws. Transient states receive zero mass. The set of these probabilities is a simplex, not a vector space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次链的全部平稳概率是闭类稳态的唯一凸组合，暂态质量为零；组成单纯形，并非向量空间。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2960,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b100000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFinite-chain limits use class-entry probabilities; one closed class makes the limit common to all starts.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限链极限按入类概率混合；唯一闭类才让全部初态共享同一极限。",
      "x": 2930,
      "y": 3000,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 230
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有限CTMC全局收敛|Long-time limits of a finite CTMC]]\n\nEvery initial law of a finite homogeneous CTMC converges. The probabilities of entering each closed class select its limiting mixture. All starts share one limit exactly when there is one closed class.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次链从每个初态都收敛；进入各闭类的概率决定极限混合。恰有一个闭类时，所有初态才共享同一极限。",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 2960,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC详细平衡|Detailed balance]]\n\nBalance each pair of weighted rate flows: $w_iq_{ij}=w_jq_{ji}$. Unequal rates can balance unequal occupancy. Nonnegative weights must have positive finite total mass before normalization to probabilities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n逐对匹配加权速率流 $w_iq_{ij}=w_jq_{ji}$，不要求速率本身相同。非负权重总和正且有限才可归一化。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3270,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b100000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nPairwise rate flow gives the local side of the finite-state equivalence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n逐对速率流是有限状态等价定理的局部条件。",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 3310,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000022",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC可逆性|Reversibility]]\n\nUnder the stationary initial law, reflecting the time axis preserves every finite-dimensional distribution. Reflect unequal observation gaps too. Individual paths need not be palindromes, and arbitrary initial laws need not be reversible.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在平稳初始律下，时间反射保持所有有限维分布；不等观察间隔也须反射。路径不必是回文，任意初始律也不自动可逆。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3570,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nStationary time reflection gives the path-law side of the equivalence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n平稳时间反射给出等价定理的路径律表述。",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 3610,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 210
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC详细平衡与可逆|Detailed balance and reversibility]]\n\nFor a finite homogeneous chain and the same probability law, detailed balance is equivalent to reversibility; both imply stationarity. Zero probability weights are allowed. A stationary directed cycle need not be reversible.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次链对同一概率律，详细平衡当且仅当可逆，二者推出平稳。允许零权重；平稳环流可以不可逆。",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 3420,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nFor positive neighboring birth/death rates, pairwise balance gives relative weights; normalization and process conditions remain.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n相邻出生／死亡率为正时，逐对平衡给出相对权重；仍须归一化并检查过程条件。",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 3460,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[生灭链平稳递推|Birth–death stationary weights]]\n\nPositive adjacent rates give $w_0=1$ and $w_{n+1}/w_n=\\lambda_n/\\mu_{n+1}$. Check that their sum is finite, then normalize. On infinitely many states, also verify nonexplosion of the chosen minimal process.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n相邻正率先递推相对权重，再检查总和有限并归一化。无限状态还须确认所选最小过程非爆炸；零率屏障先按类处理。",
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 3420,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nConstant arrival and single-server service rates produce geometric weights; infinite capacity still requires their sum to converge.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n常数到达率与单服务台服务率给出几何权重；无限容量仍须检查可归一化。",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 3460,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[M-M-1稳态人数|M/M/1 system size]]\n\nIndependent Poisson arrivals of rate $\\lambda>0$ and one exponential server of rate $\\mu>0$, with unlimited capacity: stationary total count has $\\pi_n=(1-\\rho)\\rho^n$ exactly when $\\rho=\\lambda/\\mu<1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n到达与服务独立、正有限率、单服务台且容量无限时，平稳系统总人数为几何律；系统人数包含服务中的一人。有限容量另论。",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 3420,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7a1000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · 从完整路径估计生成率\n\n观测到每次真实跳时后，数据同时提供跳转计数与在各状态的暴露时间。若多条边共享一个参数，必须先施加共同率约束，再汇总信息。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3880,
      "width": 5000,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c1000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC完整路径估计|Rates from a complete path]]\n\nFinite homogeneous model, fixed window, every genuine jump observed, conditional on the initial state: free off-diagonal rates have $\\widehat q_{ij}=N_{ij}/S_i$ for positive exposure $S_i$. Include the final unfinished wait.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限齐次模型在固定窗内完整观察，并条件于初态；自由速率用跳数除以正暴露。末段等待也计入，零暴露不能写成0/0。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4110,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7b1000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nApply the parameter constraints before maximizing. Each shared outgoing edge contributes its own weighted exposure.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先代入参数约束再最大化；同一状态的每条共享出口分别贡献加权暴露。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 4150,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "c7c100000000001f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC共同率估计|Shared-rate estimation]]\n\nIn the complete-path model, known $q_{ij}=c_{ij}\\theta$ with $c_{ij}>0$ gives the nonnegative-parameter MLE $\\widehat\\theta=\\sum N_{ij}/\\sum c_{ij}S_i$ on those edges when weighted exposure is positive. If zero is excluded, zero counts give a boundary supremum. Other off-diagonal rates do not depend on $\\theta$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n完整路径下先施加已知比例约束；共享边的跳数除以加权暴露。正暴露零跳数仍进分母；是否允许零参数须按模型判断。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 4110,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0063-exp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -920,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[指数分布|Exponential distribution]]\n\nA continuous waiting-time law with rate $\\lambda>0$: $P(T>t)=e^{-\\lambda t}$ for $t\\ge0$, and mean $1/\\lambda$. Check rate versus scale and time units.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n连续等待的基础分布；速率不是概率，也不是均值。用生存概率先读懂“还要等多久”。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0063-memoryless",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -920,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[指数分布无记忆性|Exponential memorylessness]]\n\nGiven that waiting is still unfinished at time $s$, the remaining wait has the original exponential law. Within positive finite waiting laws, the memoryless property characterizes the exponential distribution.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n给定已等待且仍未结束，剩余等待同分布；逆命题须保留有限等待等条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0064-stopped-information",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\nA [[停时定义|stopping time]] is recognized from observations already made. The [[停时信息集|information at that time]] is the conditioning object for restart; a last-jump time may look ahead.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n停时不偷看未来；停时信息集记录截至停止所知的事件。“截止前最后一次跳跃”通常不能这样重新开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0064-strong-markov",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3200,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CTMC强Markov性|Strong Markov property]]\n\nFor a standard homogeneous CTMC, restart at a finite stopping time before explosion. Given the reached state, the future has the corresponding fresh law independently of the past.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n给定到达状态后重新开始整个概率律；并非与到达状态无条件独立，也不规定尚未指定的爆炸后延拓。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0066-countable-dtmc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4000,
      "y": 2960,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可数Markov链平衡收敛|Discrete theorem for a CTMC skeleton]]\n\nFor a time-homogeneous, irreducible nonexplosive CTMC with finite exit rates and stationary probability, observing $X_{nh}$ at fixed $h>0$ gives transition $P(h)$, which is irreducible, aperiodic and preserves $\\pi$. Apply the countable discrete theorem.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对时间齐次、不可约非爆炸、出口率逐项有限且有平稳概率的 CTMC，固定间隔观察得到 $P(h)$；它不可约、非周期并保持平稳律。此骨架不同于真实跳链。"
    }
  ],
